; Alcotest suite for the `vulkan` library (DESIGN.md §12). All headless,
; targeting the Mesa lavapipe software Vulkan device (VK_ICD_FILENAMES).
;
; test_enums.ml/test_layout.ml/test_structs.ml/test_instance.ml/
; test_compute.ml/test_graphics.ml were originally written blind against
; DESIGN.md (each still carries its own assumptions comment block at the
; top, now reconciled against the real generated API by the integration
; lane); test_enum_values.ml is the enum-value golden check (DESIGN.md
; §5/§10/§12/§13), added by the integration lane alongside test_layout.ml's
; struct-layout golden check; test_runner.ml is the thin `Alcotest.run`
; entry point wiring all of their suites together.
;
; `(deps (source_tree layout) (source_tree enum_values))` makes dune mirror
; test/layout/*.txt and test/enum_values/*.txt into the sandbox
; test_layout.ml/test_enum_values.ml run from
; (_build/default/test/{layout,enum_values}/...) -- without it
; Sys.file_exists always sees a missing golden file and the test silently
; skips instead of comparing.
(test
 (name test_runner)
 (libraries vulkan vk_test_shaders alcotest ctypes integers)
 (deps
  (source_tree layout)
  (source_tree enum_values)))
